            "vimeo_url": "123456789",
            "enable_video_looping": false,
            "liquid_content": "<br><strong>A special message from our ParentLink team:</strong> Your questions are important to us! We have approached our peak season and our call center is experiencing high call and high email volume making wait times longer than usual. We appreciate your patience as we continue to assist as expeditiously as possible, thank you for being a loyal consumer to Evenflo!<br>\n\n<h4>Chat with us</h4>\n\nChat with a live ParentLink Consumer Care representative at any time during business hours. Just look for the chat icon on the bottom right-hand side of your screen.</p>",
            "title": "Looking for help",
            "text": "<p>You're welcome to contact Evenflo directly <strong>Monday through Friday between 8am and 5pm ET</strong>. We provide support for both US and Canada, and cover Evenflo, Evenflo GOLD, ExerSaucer, Snugli, and Urbini branded products.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
